&#x201C;This year&#x2019;s nominees are proof that experience is one of the most powerful creative forces in film and television,&#x201D; said Dr. Myechia Minter-Jordan, CEO of AARP. &#x201C;From legends like Meryl Streep and Helen Mirren to acclaimed creators like Christopher Nolan and Chris Rock, these artists are doing some of the best work of their careers and reminding audiences and the industry alike that great stories have no age limit.&#x201D;

Hosted by five-time Emmy winner Jane Lynch, The AARP Movies & TV for Grownups Awards will take place on Saturday, January 9, 2027, at the Beverly Wilshire, Beverly Hills. It will be broadcast on PBS, Great Performances Friday February 26, 2027.

In what vertical series platform ReelShort is billing as the first of its kind, recording artist Macy Gray plans to release her new album via an original scripted microdrama. The vertical series, titled &#x201C; The Trouble With the Truth ,&#x201D; will star Gray and feature songs from her next album.

ReelShort&#x2019;s Sunflower Studio is behind &#x201C;The Trouble With the Truth,&#x201D; with casting currently underway for the series. The studio and platform plan to start production on the series in January 2027 and time the release to Gray&#x2019;s album, which will also be titled &#x201C;The Trouble With the Truth.&#x201D; Gray is looking at a 2027 Q1 release for the new music. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories Microdrama Makers From Turkey and Japan Bet on Emotional Hooks and Infuriating Villains at Taiwan Creative Content Fest India's T-Series and Hungama Launch Microdrama Platform FastTV With $32 Million Commitment (EXCLUSIVE)

According to Sunflower Studio and ReelShort, the plan is to integrate Gray&#x2019;s new songs into the series&#x2019; original dramatic narrative. Said the company in a release: &#x201C;The partnership reflects ReelShort&#x2019;s continued evolution as a destination for original storytelling while opening new possibilities for recording artists to introduce music, engage fans and expand their creative reach through scripted entertainment.&#x201D;

Added Sunflower Studio head Fiona Li: &#x201C;Vertical drama has so much potential beyond traditional storytelling, and this partnership is an exciting step toward exploring what&#x2019;s possible. Collaborating with an iconic artist like Macy Gray allows us to push the boundaries of the format, bringing vertical drama into the world of music and opening up new ways for artists and audiences to connect.&#x201D;

Gray first hit the scene in 1999 with her first album, &#x201C;On How Life Is,&#x201D; which was certified three-time platinum by the RIAA, earning her a Grammy for best female pop vocal performance for the song &#x201C;I Try.&#x201D; Other hits from the release included &#x201C;Why Didn&#x2019;t You Call Me,&#x201D; &#x201C;Do Something&#x201D; and &#x201C;Still.&#x201D; Gray has released 10 studio albums and one live album. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#x201C;The Trouble With the Truth&#x201D; reps Gray's first new album release in nearly a decade; her last album, &#x201C;Ruby,&#x201D; was put out in 2018.

Gray is repped by Debra Baum of Eliseo Entertainment LLC, while her music label is DNA Music/Hitmaker Distro.
